    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you mentioned \"initial challenges\" regarding the job losses—but isn't it more accurate to say that the rapid transition could lead to permanent structural unemployment in those regions? some analysts argue the \"green jobs\" won't actually replace the high-paying manual labor roles lost in the fossil fuel industry. can you dig into why that's such a major concern?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
